Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:55:47 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8150-microsoft-surface-duo: describe the
 workbench hardware

Panels, touch, audio (WCD9340 + WSA8815, DMIC2/3), charger, GPU, sensors DSPs, Wi-Fi/BT, USB-C, Venus, CAMSS +
IMX351 (rotation 90, verified) + DW9719 lens, flash LED, haptics, as dtsi files included by the board DTS.

This patch was written by Claude (Anthropic's AI assistant) under the direction of Bryson, who reviewed and
tested it on a Surface Duo.

Signed-off-by: Bryson <10244083+brysonwf@users.noreply.github.com>
